          "start_time": 27.696,
          "end_time": 27.696,
          "language": "yue"
        },
        {
          "text": "I would recommend we bring in one more frontend engineer to keep us on track.",
          "start_time": 15.168,
          "end_time": 21.408,
          "language": "en"
        },
        {
          "text": "\n",
          "start_time": 27.696,
          "end_time": 27.696,
          "language": "yue"
        },
        {
          "text": "如果一切順利，我哋下星期五之前應該可以準備好內部演示。",
